@prefix qce: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/qualified-capability-ecology#> .
@prefix ex: <https://example.test/qce/> .
ex:before a qce:AuthorityEnvelope ; qce:delegationDepth 1 .
ex:after a qce:AuthorityEnvelope ; qce:delegationDepth 3 .
ex:r a qce:SubstitutionReceipt ;
  qce:predecessorAuthority ex:before ;
  qce:successorAuthority ex:after .
